     1|/**
     2| * IVX Buyer Discovery Engine — REAL named buyers/acquirers from public SEC filings.
     3| *
     4| * This is the buyer-side counterpart to `ivx-investor-discovery`. It reuses the
     5| * same LEGAL, verifiable SEC EDGAR Form D source (every U.S. Reg D private
     6| * placement is a public federal filing with the issuer's real legal name,
     7| * principals, business address, and offering amount), then deterministically
     8| * CLASSIFIES each discovered entity into one of the seven buyer types the owner
     9| * asked for:
    10| *
    11| *   cash_buyer · family_office · developer · operator · acquisition_group ·
    12| *   broker · reit
    13| *
    14| * Nothing is fabricated: every buyer record carries the original SEC filing link
    15| * for verification. The classification is a transparent, rule-based read of the
    16| * filer's public entity name + declared industry/entity type — never a guess
    17| * presented as fact (the matched signal is returned on every record).
    18| *
    19| * Read-only. No personal mobile numbers, no scraped private data — only the
    20| * business contact information the filer chose to make public on a federal form.
    21| */
